                  "fill": "#333333",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Mint #39E19E is a fill, not light-mode text (≈1.7:1 on white). On light, text/links use #008751 (≈4.6:1).",
